                "text": "ISSUE_KIND: road_damage\nISSUE: Roadway cave-in / sinkhole next to storm drain on Tecumseh Street\nDETAILS: The photo shows a large, deep sinkhole where the concrete roadway has caved in next to a manhole/storm drain, with a wooden barricade and a leaning street sign in the hole. The user note states the road caved in next to the storm drain, about 4 feet across, and mentions \"Adelphi Woods Homeowners Association\" (which has no public record; Tecumseh Street in unincorporated Adelphi is a public residential street).\nORGANIZATION: Prince George's County Department of Public Works and Transportation\nDEPARTMENT: Office of Highway Maintenance (Road Maintenance Division)\nWHY: Tecumseh Street is a residential street in unincorporated Adelphi, Prince George's County, Maryland. The Prince George's County Department of Public Works and Transportation (DPW&T) maintains County-maintained roadways, including the repair of sinkholes and roadway pavement.\nCOVERAGE_QUOTE: \"As part of the Prince George's County Roadway Preservation Program, maintenance includes the repair of sinkholes and potholes, shoulder repair, removal and replacement of concrete curb and gutter, sidewalks, driveway aprons, the installation of underdrains, the installation and/or upgrade of handicapped access ramps per ADA standards and the repair/resurfacing of the roadway pavement.\"\nCOVERAGE_URL: https://www.princegeorgescountymd.gov/departments-offices/public-works-transportation/about-dpwt/office-highway-maintenance\nREPORTING_URL: https://pgc311.com\nOFFICIAL_WEBSITE: https://www.princegeorgescountymd.gov/departments-offices/public-works-transportation\nEMAIL: unknown\nPHONE: 301-883-4748 | https://www.princegeorgescountymd.gov/departments-offices/public-works-transportation/report-public-works-problem/roadway-hazards\nPHOTO_LOOKS_DAYTIME: unknown\nNOTE_SAYS_LIGHT_OUT: unknown\nSOURCES:\nhttps://www.princegeorgescountymd.gov/departments-offices/public-works-transportation/about-dpwt/office-highway-maintenance\nhttps://www.princegeorgescountymd.gov/departments-offices/public-works-transportation/report-public-works-problem/roadway-hazards\nhttps://pgc311.com",
